      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2025-2-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2026-2-E</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-31" id="fn-31" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2026-5-G</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Per SCPSC Docket No. 2005-5-G, commodity and demand components of purchased gas cost are recovered separately. Balances for these components as of March 31, 2026 are as follows:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:39.880%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:48.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:48.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
