        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2012-218-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2020-125-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2024-34-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Pursuant to the Comprehensive Settlement Agreement approved by the SCPSC in DESC's Retail Electric Base Rate Case (Docket No. 2020-125-E), annual amortization of $4,389,969 began September 2021. The SCPSC's order also authorized additional incremental storm cost deferrals to this account.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Pursuant to the Comprehensive Settlement Agreement approved by SCPSC in DESC's Retail Electric Base Rate Case (Docket No. 2024-34-E), deferrals to this account ceased September 1, 2024 and the annual amortization of $4,389,969 will remain in effect until the asset is fully amortized which will be at June 2034.</span>
      </div>
