      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">513 / 553 / 555</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-89" id="fn-89" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Represents net proceeds received under or arising from the monetization of the Settlement Agreement dated as of July 27, 2017 with Toshiba Corporation. By Order No 2018-804 issued in Docket No. 2017-370-E, the SCPSC ordered $1.032 billion to be credited to customers over twenty years beginning in February 2019.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">In March 2022 in SCPSC Docket No. 2022-2-E, DESC applied approximately $61.3 million of the regulatory liability as a reduction to its retail electric undercollected base fuel cost balance.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-90" id="fn-90" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">131 / 182.3 / 440 / 442 / 444 / 445</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-91" id="fn-91" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2024-34-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:6pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Pursuant to the Comprehensive Settlement Agreement approved by the SCPSC in DESC's Retail Electric Base Rate Case (Docket No. 2024-34-E), DESC anticipates providing all funds to residential customers within the five year term (2025-2029).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-92" id="fn-92" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:4pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2012-218-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:4pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2020-172-E</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-bottom:4pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">SCPSC Docket No. 2020-125-E</span>
